    "reviewer": "Claude Opus 5.5 (declaration-only-builds PR 3, check once)",
    "reason": "Record the configuration drift of check once: the root turbo.json check task depends on the package's own build as well as ^build, and bun run beep lint package-scripts --write rewrote 180 declaration-only scripts blocks so beep:check leads with tsrs -p tsconfig.json --emitDeclarationOnly instead of tsrs -p tsconfig.check.json (first-segment flags such as @beep/repo-cli's --checkerCostCache carried over), re-keying the command digest of every task of the written packages, cached or not. The 19 packages whose build is not declaration-only keep their previous check graph through an explicit tasks.check.dependsOn [\"^build\"] in their own turbo.json. Task commands, cache flags, inputs, outputs and environment are unchanged; no qualification is granted.",
